---
const ebook = 'https://www.naffy.io/peakclassdetail/poradnik-Aof';
---
<section class="ebook" id="ebook">
  <div class="wrap ebook__grid">
    <div class="book" data-book aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="book__obj" data-book-obj>
        <div class="book__cover">
          <span class="book__brand">Peak Class Detail</span>
          <span class="display book__title">Top<br />produkty<br /><em>detailingowe</em></span>
          <span class="book__foot">E-book · poradnik</span>
        </div>
        <div class="book__spine"></div>
        <div class="book__pages"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ebook__copy">
      <h2 class="display h2 rise">
        <span class="ln"><span>Poradnik</span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span>bez <em>reklam.</em></span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead rise-fade">Ponad dwa lata testów na setkach aut, bez współprac i sponsorowanych opinii. Tylko produkty, które naprawdę działają.</p>
      <ul class="ebook__list rise-fade">
        <li>Lista sprawdzonych kosmetyków do lakieru, wnętrza i felg</li>
        <li>Jak, kiedy i do czego używać każdego z nich</li>
        <li>Jak nie przepłacać i jakich błędów unikać</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="ebook__price rise-fade">Kosztuje mniej niż kebab w Twoim mieście.</p>
      <a class="act act--accent ebook__act" href={ebook} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kup e-book <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gift" id="prezent">
  <div class="wrap gift__grid">
    <div class="gift__copy">
      <h2 class="display h2 rise">
        <span class="ln"><span>Podaruj czysty</span></span>
        <span class="ln"><span><em>komfort.</em></span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead rise-fade">Bon albo voucher na detailing. Dla kogoś, kto kocha swoje auto, a nie ma czasu się nim zająć.</p>
      <a class="act act--accent rise-fade" href="tel:+48881265265">Zamów bon: 881 265 265 <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="ticket sweep" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ticket__main">
        <span class="caption">Bon podarunkowy</span>
        <span class="display ticket__title">Na dowolną<br /><em>usługę.</em></span>
        <span class="ticket__line">Peak Class Detail · mobilny detailing</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket__stub">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M6 9h28L20 33z" /></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ebook { padding: clamp(5.625rem, 14vh, 10.625rem) 0 clamp(3.75rem, 9vh, 6.875rem); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), var(--bg-2)); }
  .ebook__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6.875rem); align-items: center; }
  .ebook__list { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .ebook__list li { position: relative; padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .ebook__list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.62em; width: 0.55rem; height: 0.55rem; background: var(--accent); clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 50% 100%); }
  .ebook__price { margin-top: 1.4rem; color: var(--mute); font-style: italic; }
  .ebook__act { margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .ebook__copy .lead { margin-top: 1.4rem; }

  .book { perspective: 1400px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 4% 0; }
  .book__obj { container-type: inline-size; position: relative; width: min(21rem, 70%); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4.2; transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateY(-24deg) rotateX(6deg); }
  .book__cover, .book__spine, .book__pages { position: absolute; }
  .book__cover {
    inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12% 10%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 60% at 80% 0%, rgba(91, 140, 255, 0.28), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #141b27, #06080b 70%);
    border-radius: 2px 6px 6px 2px;
    box-shadow: inset 4px 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), 30px 40px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    transform: translateZ(14px);
  }
  .book__cover::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09) 50%, transparent 60%); background-size: 250% 100%; background-position: var(--gloss, 100%) 0; border-radius: inherit; }
  .book__brand { font-size: max(0.6rem, 4cqw); letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); font-stretch: 115%; }
  .book__title { font-size: 7.4cqw; line-height: 0.92; } /* "detailingowe" must fit inside the cover */
  .book__foot { font-size: max(0.6rem, 4cqw); color: var(--mute); }
  .book__spine { left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 28px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0a0e14, #1a2230); transform-origin: left; transform: rotateY(90deg) translateX(-14px) translateZ(0); }
  .book__pages { right: 0; top: 2%; bottom: 2%; width: 26px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #d9dde4 0 1px, #b9bec8 1px 2px); transform-origin: right; transform: rotateY(90deg) translateX(13px); }

  .gift { padding: clamp(3.75rem, 9vh, 6.875rem) 0 clamp(5.625rem, 14vh, 10.625rem); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-2), var(--bg)); }
  .gift__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6.875rem); align-items: center; }
  .gift__copy .lead { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .gift__copy .act { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .ticket { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; transform: rotate(-4deg); filter: drop-shadow(0 30px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55)); max-width: 32.5rem; justify-self: center; width: 100%; }
  .ticket__main {
    display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; padding: 9% 8%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9edf3, #c8cfda 55%, #eef2f8);
    color: #0a0d12;
    -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(circle 10px at 100% 0, transparent 98%, #000) top / 100% 51% no-repeat, radial-gradient(circle 10px at 100% 100%, transparent 98%, #000) bottom / 100% 51% no-repeat;
            mask: radial-gradient(circle 10px at 100% 0, transparent 98%, #000) top / 100% 51% no-repeat, radial-gradient(circle 10px at 100% 100%, transparent 98%, #000) bottom / 100% 51% no-repeat;
  }
  .ticket__main .caption { color: #4b5463; }
  .ticket__title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); }
  .ticket__title em { color: #2f5fd6; }
  .ticket__line { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4b5463; }
  .ticket__stub { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 84px; background: var(--accent); border-left: 2px dashed rgba(6, 8, 11, 0.35); }
  .ticket__stub svg { width: 34px; fill: none; stroke: #06080b; stroke-width: 3.4; stroke-linejoin: round; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .ebook__grid, .gift__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ebook__grid { grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
    .ebook__copy { display: contents; }
    .ebook__copy h2 { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1; }
    .book { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; padding: 0; }
    .book__obj { width: 100%; }
    .ebook__copy .lead { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; margin-top: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .ebook__list, .ebook__price, .ebook__act { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .ebook__list { font-size: 0.93rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
    .ticket { max-width: 360px; }
    .ticket__stub { width: 60px; }
  }
</style>
